    <string name="experiment_auto_confirm">Enable automatic route learning?</string>
    <string name="experiment_auto_note">Only correlated unmatched-direct TCP timeouts with fresh healthy proxy tests qualify. Learning validates and reloads the tunnel, interrupting active connections. It is local to this phone and can be reversed.</string>
    <string name="experiment_signal_limits">off/auto leave unmatched traffic direct; on uses the proxy exit. Explicit direct/reject policy keeps priority. Cloudflare learning requires an explicit regional-block signal in core logs; encrypted browser error pages and generic 403s cannot be inferred.</string>
