    <string name="experiment_fallback_note">Uses fresh group latency tests and the host priority list. Manual choices outside that list are preserved. Tests settle for 10 seconds; manual recovery has a 90-second cooldown. A faulty exit cannot be repaired by changing entry nodes.</string>
